# Project Guidelines
Refer to [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the project overview, coding rules, and quality gate commands.

- **Stack**: TypeScript, Vite, Inglorious Forge (`@inglorious/store`, `@inglorious/web`, `@inglorious/ui`, `@inglorious/i18n`).
- **Pattern**: Entity-Component-System (ECS). Plain entities in store, behavior and render in types, communication via `api.notify`.
- **Quality Gates**: Always ensure `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build` pass without errors or warnings.
